WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.283 --> 00:00:06.982
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IN OUR OPENING SHOW

00:00:06.983 --> 00:00:09.185
OF THE YEAR, WE TALKED ABOUT THE

00:00:09.186 --> 00:00:10.019
CENTRAL PROBLEM OF AMERICAN

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.787
POLITICS WHICH IS OUR LEADERS

00:00:11.788 --> 00:00:13.823
HAVE LOST SIGHT OF THE POINT OF

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:14.356
BEING IN CHARGE.

00:00:14.357 --> 00:00:17.426
THEIR GOAL SHOULD BE SIMPLE,

00:00:17.427 --> 00:00:18.394
STRONG, AMERICAN FAMILIES.

00:00:18.395 --> 00:00:20.763
ANYTHING THAT MAKES IT HARDER TO

00:00:20.764 --> 00:00:22.364
FORM STRONG FAMILIES, THEY OUGHT

00:00:22.365 --> 00:00:23.199
TO BE AGAINST.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.500
JUDGING BY THE RESPONSE WE GOT,

00:00:24.501 --> 00:00:27.169
A LOT OF YOU AGREE WITH THAT.

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:28.270
THAT PIECE RESONATED MORE THAN

00:00:28.271 --> 00:00:30.973
ANYTHING WE'VE DONE IN THE LAST

00:00:30.974 --> 00:00:31.373
TWO YEARS.

00:00:31.374 --> 00:00:33.008
IN WASHINGTON THOUGH IT WASN'T

00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:34.043
VERY POPULAR.

00:00:34.044 --> 00:00:36.579
ONE WRITE A REVIEW SUGGESTED WE

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:39.949
WERE PEDDLING SOMETHING CALLED

00:00:39.950 --> 00:00:40.549
VICTIMHOOD OF POPULISM.

00:00:40.550 --> 00:00:43.285
THAT'S NOT THE POINT.

00:00:43.286 --> 00:00:47.623
POPULISM IS NEVER THE GOAL.

00:00:47.624 --> 00:00:48.757
FOR SO LONG, VOTERS FEEL LIKE

00:00:48.758 --> 00:00:50.559
THEY HAVE TO PUNISH THE PEOPLE

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.561
IN CHARGE TO GET THEIR

00:00:52.562 --> 00:00:52.928
ATTENTION.

00:00:52.929 --> 00:00:54.563
POPULISM IS A SMOKE ALARM,

00:00:54.564 --> 00:00:56.432
IGNORE IT AND THE PLACE BURNS

00:00:56.433 --> 00:00:56.732
DOWN.

00:00:56.733 --> 00:00:59.168
ON THE LEFT MEANWHILE, THE

00:00:59.169 --> 00:01:01.804
RESPONSE WAS JUST AS

00:01:01.805 --> 00:01:02.204
PREDICTABLE.

00:01:02.205 --> 00:01:03.205
THEY SCREAMED BIGOTRY.

00:01:03.206 --> 00:01:05.274
IN THIS CASE, THEY ACCUSED US OF

00:01:05.275 --> 00:01:06.375
SEXISM.

00:01:06.376 --> 00:01:08.577
WE DARED TO TALK ABOUT THE ROLE

00:01:08.578 --> 00:01:09.311
OF FALLING MALE WAGES IN THE

00:01:09.312 --> 00:01:11.780
DESTRUCTION OF THE AMERICAN

00:01:11.781 --> 00:01:13.949
FAMILY, THAT'S NOT ALLOWED TO.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:14.783
BUT LET THE RECORD REFLECT THAT

00:01:14.784 --> 00:01:17.353
WE ARE NOT THE FIRST ONES TO

00:01:17.354 --> 00:01:18.354
NOTICE THIS PHENOMENON.

00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:19.154
THERE'S AT LEAST ONE WELL-KNOWN

00:01:19.155 --> 00:01:20.522
POLITICIAN WHO THOUGHT DEEPLY

00:01:20.523 --> 00:01:22.925
ABOUT THIS MORE THAN A DECADE

00:01:22.926 --> 00:01:24.727
AGO AND WROTE AN ENTIRE BOOK ON

00:01:24.728 --> 00:01:25.127
THE SUBJECT.

00:01:25.128 --> 00:01:28.063
SEE IF YOU CAN GUESS WHO THAT

00:01:28.064 --> 00:01:30.532
WAS.

00:01:30.533 --> 00:01:31.100
ALL RIGHT, TIME'S UP.

00:01:31.101 --> 00:01:33.969
IT WAS ELIZABETH WARREN.

00:01:33.970 --> 00:01:35.771
SHE WAS A HARVARD PROFESSOR WHO

00:01:35.772 --> 00:01:37.339
PUBLISHED A BOOK WITH HER

00:01:37.340 --> 00:01:38.307
DAUGHTER ENTITLED, THE TWO

00:01:38.308 --> 00:01:39.141
INCOME TRAP.

00:01:39.142 --> 00:01:40.976
WHY MIDDLE-CLASS MOTHERS AND

00:01:40.977 --> 00:01:42.177
FATHERS ARE GOING BROKE.

00:01:42.178 --> 00:01:43.612
THE CENTRAL THESIS OF THE BOOK

00:01:43.613 --> 00:01:45.047
WAS AT THE MASSIVE ENTRY OF

00:01:45.048 --> 00:01:46.415
MOTHERS INTO THE WORKFORCE HAS

00:01:46.416 --> 00:01:48.384
BEEN A DISASTER FOR FAMILIES,

00:01:48.385 --> 00:01:50.252
MOST OF ALL, FOR WOMEN.

00:01:50.253 --> 00:01:51.253
MOTHERS WHO WORK HAVE TO SPEND

00:01:51.254 --> 00:01:53.188
FAR MORE TIME AWAY FROM THEIR

00:01:53.189 --> 00:01:54.223
KIDS WHICH FOR MANY ISN'T

00:01:54.224 --> 00:01:57.059
LIBERATING SO MUCH AS IT IS

00:01:57.060 --> 00:01:57.459
DEEPLY SAD.

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:58.961
COMPANIES LOVE IT OF COURSE

00:01:58.962 --> 00:01:59.595
BECAUSE MORE WORKERS MEAN

00:01:59.596 --> 00:02:01.563
CHEAPER LABOR.

00:02:01.564 --> 00:02:02.898
MIDDLE-CLASS FAMILIES DON'T SEEM

00:02:02.899 --> 00:02:05.367
HAPPIER OR MORE SECURE THAN THEY

00:02:05.368 --> 00:02:07.036
WERE A GENERATION AGO.

00:02:07.037 --> 00:02:08.370
IF ANYTHING, MUCH LESS.

00:02:08.371 --> 00:02:10.005
AS WARREN POINTS OUT, YOU WOULD

00:02:10.006 --> 00:02:11.573
THINK FAMILIES WOULD BE MUCH

00:02:11.574 --> 00:02:13.809
RICHER WITH TWO PARENTS WORKING,

00:02:13.810 --> 00:02:14.543
BUT THAT HASN'T HAPPENED.

00:02:14.544 --> 00:02:16.378
WHILE THE INCOME GAMES HAVE BEEN

00:02:16.379 --> 00:02:18.414
CONSUMED IN AN ARMS RACE TO

00:02:18.415 --> 00:02:19.214
MAINTAIN THE STATUS QUO.

00:02:19.215 --> 00:02:20.282
MOST THINGS IN AMERICAN LIFE

00:02:20.283 --> 00:02:21.583
WERE CHEAPER THAN THEY WERE 50

00:02:21.584 --> 00:02:23.719
YEARS AGO EXCEPT FOR THE THINGS

00:02:23.720 --> 00:02:24.653
THAT MIDDLE-CLASS FAMILIES NEED

00:02:24.654 --> 00:02:27.156
MOST IN THOSE ARE MUCH MORE

00:02:27.157 --> 00:02:28.991
EXPENSIVE.

00:02:28.992 --> 00:02:31.026
HEALTH CARE, DAY CARE, COLLEGE

00:02:31.027 --> 00:02:32.428
TUITION, HOUSING AND PLACES WITH

00:02:32.429 --> 00:02:33.395
GOOD PUBLIC SCHOOLS.

00:02:33.396 --> 00:02:34.863
BUYING THOSE THINGS REQUIRES TWO

00:02:34.864 --> 00:02:36.432
INCOMES RATHER THAN ONE, WHICH

00:02:36.433 --> 00:02:38.000
PUTS A STRAIN ON FAMILIES IN

00:02:38.001 --> 00:02:41.804
WHICH BOTH PARENTS WORK.

00:02:41.805 --> 00:02:44.173
WARREN PUTS IT THIS WAY.

00:02:44.174 --> 00:02:46.141
"A GENERATION AGO A SINGLE

00:02:46.142 --> 00:02:46.775
BREADWINNER WHO WORKED

00:02:46.776 --> 00:02:47.476
DILIGENTLY AND SPENT CAREFULLY

00:02:47.477 --> 00:02:51.146
COULD ASSURE HIS FAMILY A

00:02:51.147 --> 00:02:51.814
COMFORTABLE POSITION IN THE

00:02:51.815 --> 00:02:53.248
MIDDLE CLASS BUT THE FRENZIED

00:02:53.249 --> 00:02:54.750
BIDDING WARS FUELED BY FAMILIES

00:02:54.751 --> 00:02:56.085
WITH TWO INCOMES CHANGE THE GAME

00:02:56.086 --> 00:02:58.020
FOR SINGLE INCOME FAMILIES AS

00:02:58.021 --> 00:02:59.388
WELL PUSHING THEM DOWN THE

00:02:59.389 --> 00:03:00.622
ECONOMIC LADDER.

00:03:00.623 --> 00:03:02.891
TO KEEP MOM AT HOME, THE AVERAGE

00:03:02.892 --> 00:03:06.028
SINGLE INCOME FAMILY MUST

00:03:06.029 --> 00:03:08.263
FORFEIT DECENT SCHOOLS AND

00:03:08.264 --> 00:03:08.864
COLLEGE DEGREES, LEAVING

00:03:08.865 --> 00:03:10.466
THEMSELVES AND THEIR CHILDREN

00:03:10.467 --> 00:03:11.400
WITH A TENUOUS HOLD ON

00:03:11.401 --> 00:03:12.134
MIDDLE-CLASS DREAMS.

00:03:12.135 --> 00:03:14.770
SUCH PRESSURES HAVE TAKEN THESE

00:03:14.771 --> 00:03:16.805
WOMEN OUT OF THE HOME AND AWAY

00:03:16.806 --> 00:03:18.173
FROM CHILDREN AND SIMULTANEOUSLY

00:03:18.174 --> 00:03:22.544
MADE FAMILY LIFE LESS, NOT MORE,

00:03:22.545 --> 00:03:23.078
FINANCIALLY SECURE.

00:03:23.079 --> 00:03:23.812
TODAY'S MIDDLE-CLASS MOTHER IS

00:03:23.813 --> 00:03:24.146
TRAPPED.

00:03:24.147 --> 00:03:25.047
SHE CAN'T AFFORD TO WORK AND SHE

00:03:25.048 --> 00:03:28.384
CAN'T AFFORD NOT TO.

00:03:28.385 --> 00:03:29.952
JUST TO RESTATE, THIS IS NOT A

00:03:29.953 --> 00:03:31.820
PRESS RELEASE FROM THE

00:03:31.821 --> 00:03:33.589
MENNONITES OR A POSITION PAPER

00:03:33.590 --> 00:03:35.157
FROM SOME CHRISTIAN RIGHTS

00:03:35.158 --> 00:03:36.158
THINK TANK.

00:03:36.159 --> 00:03:39.161
THIS WAS WRITTEN FAIRLY RECENTLY

00:03:39.162 --> 00:03:41.363
BY SENATOR ELIZABETH WARREN OF

00:03:41.364 --> 00:03:42.598
MASSACHUSETTS, THE SAME ONE, THE

00:03:42.599 --> 00:03:43.098
HERO TO THE LEFT.

00:03:43.099 --> 00:03:46.602
LATER IN THE BOOK, WARREN LAYS

00:03:46.603 --> 00:03:47.803
OUT THE LONG-TERM CONSEQUENCES

00:03:47.804 --> 00:03:48.937
OF AN ECONOMIC SYSTEM THAT

00:03:48.938 --> 00:03:52.141
REQUIRES BOTH PARENTS TO WORK.

00:03:52.142 --> 00:03:53.575
MORE FAMILIES GO BROKE.

00:03:53.576 --> 00:03:55.144
IT INCREASES THE RISK OF

00:03:55.145 --> 00:03:56.979
DOMESTIC ABUSE, DIVORCE AND

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:57.713
BROKEN HOMES.

00:03:57.714 --> 00:03:59.581
SOME JUST DECIDE NOT TO HAVE

00:03:59.582 --> 00:04:01.016
CHILDREN AT ALL.

00:04:01.017 --> 00:04:03.952
AND WARREN'S RESPONSE TO THAT IS

00:04:03.953 --> 00:04:04.319
STRIKING.

00:04:04.320 --> 00:04:06.555
ANOTHER QUOTE FROM ELIZABETH

00:04:06.556 --> 00:04:06.955
WARREN.

00:04:06.956 --> 00:04:07.523
"MANY OF YOU.

00:04:07.524 --> 00:04:07.956
PARENTHOOD AS

00:04:07.957 --> 00:04:11.360
NOTHING MORE THAN ANOTHER

00:04:11.361 --> 00:04:12.361
LIFESTYLE CHOICE, NOT DIFFERENT

00:04:12.362 --> 00:04:14.596
FROM JOINING A COMMUNE OR A

00:04:14.597 --> 00:04:15.764
PASSION FOR WINDSURFING.

00:04:15.765 --> 00:04:18.300
BUT WHAT HAPPENS TO A NATION

00:04:18.301 --> 00:04:20.169
THAT REWARDS CHILDLESS AND

00:04:20.170 --> 00:04:21.570
PENALIZES THE PARENTS?

00:04:21.571 --> 00:04:23.205
IF MIDDLE-CLASS MEN AND WOMEN

00:04:23.206 --> 00:04:24.406
STOP MAKING THAT PARENTAL

00:04:24.407 --> 00:04:26.375
LIFESTYLE CHOICE, WHO WILL CARE

00:04:26.376 --> 00:04:27.609
FOR THEM IN THEIR OLD AGE?

00:04:27.610 --> 00:04:30.412
WHO WILL PAY TAXES, BUILD

00:04:30.413 --> 00:04:31.847
INFRASTRUCTURE AND KEEP THE

00:04:31.848 --> 00:04:32.981
ECONOMY AFLOAT?

00:04:32.982 --> 00:04:33.715
AND MOST IMPORTANTLY, WHO WILL

00:04:33.716 --> 00:04:35.951
POPULATE THE GREAT MIDDLE-CLASS

00:04:35.952 --> 00:04:38.787
OF AMERICA'S FUTURE?

00:04:38.788 --> 00:04:41.190
AND AGAIN, WE CAN'T SAY THIS

00:04:41.191 --> 00:04:41.523
ENOUGH.

00:04:41.524 --> 00:04:45.494
ELIZABETH WARREN WROTE THAT.

00:04:45.495 --> 00:04:50.999
NOT IN 1936 BUT A MODERN ERA.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.867
ELIZABETH WARREN SAID THAT ALOUD

00:04:51.868 --> 00:04:55.404
AND NOBODY SEEMED TO MIND.

00:04:55.405 --> 00:04:56.805
NO ONE WOULD SAY THAT TODAY.

00:04:56.806 --> 00:04:59.141
WE WOULD LOVE TO TALK TO WARREN

00:04:59.142 --> 00:05:00.809
ABOUT HER BOOK ANY TIME.

00:05:00.810 --> 00:05:02.978
OBVIOUSLY SHE WON'T COME ON, SHE

00:05:02.979 --> 00:05:04.646
CAN'T TALK ABOUT THE THINGS SHE

00:05:04.647 --> 00:05:05.247
BELIEVED TEN YEARS AGO.

00:05:05.248 --> 00:05:07.749
NO BUT MODERN DEMOCRAT CAN.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:10.252
THEY CAN'T SAY THAT PROTECTING

00:05:10.253 --> 00:05:10.953
TWO-PARENT FAMILIES SHOULD BE

00:05:10.954 --> 00:05:13.489
THE GOAL.

00:05:13.490 --> 00:05:16.358
BUT WE CAN TALK ABOUT IT AND WE

00:05:16.359 --> 00:05:17.293
WILL.

